<title>USA: First Nationwide Escrow Corp issues $575 mln notes.</title>
<headline>First Nationwide Escrow Corp issues $575 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following rule 144A private placement debt issue was priced via lead manager Smith Barney Inc on Friday, a high-yield trading source said.</p>
<p>The deal was increased in size by $50 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER FIRST NATIONWIDE ESCROW CORP</p>
<p>AMT $575 MLN	     COUPON 10.625 PCT  MATURITY 10/01/03</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES     PRICE 100.00	 PAY DATE 09/19/96</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BA3	   REOFFER 100.00     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B	YIELD 10.625 PCT   CALLABLE 4-1/4 YRS</p>
<p>							FEES N.A.</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
